{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今晨（11日）7時許，警方接獲途人報案，在西區副食品批發市場發現有人在海面載浮載沉。救援人員接報到場，救起一名非華裔男子，事主昏迷送往瑪麗醫院，經搶救後證實不治。警方正調查事主身分及事故原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.000708+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:27:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:10.427789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:21.210234+00:00","content_hash":"d4407bd8c548cec2a7173c02e518e4999d76d9c0511920d13920e2a29eed44bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.000708+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}